                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "ZNZgy",
                      "name": "Regra",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": "$space-12",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "g6KVxN",
                          "name": "Rótulo",
                          "fill": "$color-text-dim",
                          "content": "REGRA",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-2xs",
                          "fontWeight": "normal",
                          "letterSpacing": "$tracking-caps"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "Aex05",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Forma: <grupo>-<papel>[-<variante>], em kebab-case, só minúsculas, sem $ e sem unidade.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "p22wFi",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Grupos fixos: color, font, text-size, font-weight, line-height, tracking, space, radius, shadow, motion, opacity, layout, size.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "IYMol",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• CSS: --<nome da variable>, idêntico. color-bg-base → --color-bg-base; space-turn → --space-turn.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "WBnLD",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Números do Pen são px, exceto: line-height-* e opacity-* (sem unidade), motion-duration-*, motion-spinner-*, motion-approval-*, motion-thinking-*, motion-timer-* (ms), motion-spinner-sibling-offset (deg), font-weight-* (número CSS).",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ILNy0",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Cor com 8 dígitos (#RRGGBBAA) vai como está; CSS aceita.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "PsVUA",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Sombra: o gerador monta --shadow-panel: 0 var(--shadow-panel-y) var(--shadow-panel-blur) var(--color-shadow-panel), e o mesmo para menu.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "K1AkgF",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Papéis apontam para a escala no CSS: --space-turn: var(--space-64). No Pen o valor é repetido porque variable não referencia variable aqui.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "LZBlY",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Estável: renomear exige migração no código. Valor pode mudar; nome não.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
