                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "pLd2H",
                      "name": "Tema claro",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": "$space-12",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "DFPuk",
                          "name": "Rótulo",
                          "fill": "$color-text-dim",
                          "content": "TEMA CLARO · GRUPO VAZIO, PENDENTE",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-2xs",
                          "fontWeight": "normal",
                          "letterSpacing": "$tracking-caps"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "q8vlBN",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Ainda não existe. Nenhum valor claro foi definido, e o documento não tem eixo de tema.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "aHCK5",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Quando vier: eixo mode com dark (atual) e light, passado como [{value, theme:{mode}}] no SetVariables. Os nomes não mudam.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "bUN4C",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• No CSS: os valores atuais ficam em :root, e o claro entra em :root[data-theme=\"light\"] com só os tokens abaixo.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "dhac9",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Precisam de valor claro (todos os de cor): color-bg-base, color-bg-sidebar, color-bg-elevated, color-bg-user, color-bg-hover, color-bg-selected, color-text-primary, color-text-secondary, color-text-dim, color-text-tree, color-border-hairline, color-border-default, color-border-control, color-icon-neutral, color-accent, color-on-accent, color-on-accent-hint, color-state-running, color-state-approval, color-state-approval-rule, color-state-approval-border, color-state-error, color-state-error-border, color-state-done, color-diff-add, color-diff-remove, color-spinner-track, color-focus-ring, color-shadow-panel, color-shadow-menu.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "QIDDT",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Provavelmente iguais nos dois temas: tipografia, espaço, raio, movimento, opacidade, layout e size. Sombra pode precisar de blur menor no claro.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "bTnAT",
                          "name": "Item",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "• Atenção: o enxofre #F3C24F e o verde #4FC48A não passam 4,5:1 sobre fundo claro; vão precisar de tons mais escuros.",
                          "lineHeight": "$line-height-ui",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-text",
                          "fontSize": "$text-size-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
